{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127125157064-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127125959\"/><p>事發在明德邨明道樓一單位。</p><p>將軍澳有人暈倒亡。今日(27日)早上10時43分，一名姓楊(52歲)男子家人報案，指楊男在明德邨明道樓一單位暈倒。人員接報到場，證實事主當場死亡，經調查後案列「屍體發現」處理，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T05:23:57.407560+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:51:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:37:20.770529+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T05:17:30.910660+00:00","content_hash":"0022e728a4a3b8dd86acea46f1c6cfad67c19134491fb01be50141b5bc5bb206","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}